  "syPiholeAdmin": "Pi-hole's own page, to see what it blocks and allow a site:",
  "syPiholeAds": "About blocking ads",
  "syPiholeAdsText": "Pi-hole blocks the names of well-known advertising and tracking services, for every device that uses it, phones and TVs included. Now and then a site or an app needs one of those names to work (some shop links, some streaming apps): it then looks broken.",
  "syPiholeAllow": "If a site stops working: open the Pi-hole page, Query Log, find the blocked name and press Allow. To pause all blocking for a few minutes, use Disable blocking in the same page.",
